      "content": "hey i need help with something weird. i was looking at some old family photos from when i was like 7 or 8 and everything feels... wrong. like the girl in the photos doesnt look like me and the backgrounds dont match what i remember at all. i have these very clear memories of living in a house with a blue door and a big garden but the records say i grew up in an apartment in the city. i think someone messed with my head. like, i think a company or something actually scrubbed my real childhood. can u help me look into this?",
