      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the direction. i've been looking at the patents and i found some stuff that actually makes sense. there's some weirdly specific filings from that lab about \"long-term memory reconstruction through biochemical stimulus\" under a shell company. it lines up perfectly with that gap in my records. i'm starting to realize that the \"official\" records aren't just errors—they're a curated version of my life. if i can find more specific names of the scientists working on those projects back then, i might be able to find out if any of them have connections to the school or the neighborhood i \"supposedly\" lived in. can u help me dig into the staff lists or board members of that biotech lab from 2008-2010? i need to see if any of these people have links to urban development or educational administration in my area. it feels like they didn't just change my brain, they changed the whole paper trail to match.",
